  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/BCDEDB">Example <span data-tag="BCDEDB">2.1.1.2</span>.</a> Let $\chi : \calD \rightarrow \Gpd $ be a functor from a category $\calD $ to the category of groupoids. Then the forgetful functor $\calC _{\chi } \rightarrow \calD $ exhibits $\calC _{\chi }$ as fibered in groupoids over $\calD $. </p>
